msgstr "取決於 *missing_as_none* 引數的值。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:165
msgid ""
"Reading the :attr:`port` attribute will raise a :exc:`ValueError` if an "
"invalid port is specified in the URL.  See section :ref:`urlparse-result-"
"object` for more information on the result object."
msgstr ""
"如果 URL 中指定了無效的連接埠，讀取 :attr:`port` 屬性時會引發 :exc:"
"`ValueError`。關於結果物件的更多資訊，請參閱\\ :ref:`urlparse-result-"
"object`\\ 一節。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:169
msgid ""
"Unmatched square brackets in the :attr:`netloc` attribute will raise a :exc:"
"`ValueError`."
msgstr ":attr:`netloc` 屬性中不成對的方括號會引發 :exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:172
msgid ""
"Characters in the :attr:`netloc` attribute that decompose under NFKC "
"normalization (as used by the IDNA encoding) into any of ``/``, ``?``, "
"``#``, ``@``, or ``:`` will raise a :exc:`ValueError`. If the URL is "
"decomposed before parsing, no error will be raised."
msgstr ""
":attr:`netloc` 屬性中若有字元在 NFKC 正規化（IDNA 編碼所使用的正規化）下會分"
"解為 ``/``、``?``、``#``、``@`` 或 ``:`` 中的任一者，就會引發 :exc:"
"`ValueError`。若 URL 在剖析前就已分解，則不會引發錯誤。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:177
msgid ""
"Following some of the `WHATWG spec`_ that updates :rfc:`3986`, leading C0 "
"control and space characters are stripped from the URL. ``\\n``, ``\\r`` and "
"tab ``\\t`` characters are removed from the URL at any position."
msgstr ""
"依循更新了 :rfc:`3986` 的 `WHATWG 規範 <WHATWG spec_>`_ 中的部分內容，URL 開"
"頭的 C0 控制字元與空格字元會被去除。``\\n``、``\\r`` 和定位字元 ``\\t`` 無論"
"位於 URL 的任何位置都會被移除。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:181
msgid ""
"As is the case with all named tuples, the subclass has a few additional "
"methods and attributes that are particularly useful. One such method is :"
"meth:`_replace`. The :meth:`_replace` method will return a new :class:"
"`SplitResult` object replacing specified fields with new values."
msgstr ""
"如同所有的附名元組，這個子類別有一些特別有用的額外方法與屬性，其中一個方法"
"是 :meth:`_replace`。:meth:`_replace` 方法會回傳一個新的 :class:"
"`SplitResult` 物件，並以新的值取代指定的欄位。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:186
msgid ""
">>> from urllib.parse import urlsplit\n"
">>> u = urlsplit('//www.cwi.nl:80/%7Eguido/Python.html')\n"
">>> u\n"
"SplitResult(scheme='', netloc='www.cwi.nl:80', path='/%7Eguido/Python."
"html',\n"
"            query='', fragment='')\n"
">>> u._replace(scheme='http')\n"
"SplitResult(scheme='http', netloc='www.cwi.nl:80', path='/%7Eguido/Python."
"html',\n"
"            query='', fragment='')"
msgstr ""
">>> from urllib.parse import urlsplit\n"
">>> u = urlsplit('//www.cwi.nl:80/%7Eguido/Python.html')\n"
">>> u\n"
"SplitResult(scheme='', netloc='www.cwi.nl:80', path='/%7Eguido/Python."
"html',\n"
"            query='', fragment='')\n"
">>> u._replace(scheme='http')\n"
"SplitResult(scheme='http', netloc='www.cwi.nl:80', path='/%7Eguido/Python."
"html',\n"
"            query='', fragment='')"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:200
msgid ""
":func:`urlsplit` does not perform validation.  See :ref:`URL parsing "
"security <url-parsing-security>` for details."
msgstr ""
":func:`urlsplit` 不會執行驗證。詳情請參閱 :ref:`URL 剖析安全性 <url-parsing-"
"security>`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:203
msgid "Added IPv6 URL parsing capabilities."
msgstr "新增剖析 IPv6 URL 的能力。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:206
msgid ""
"The fragment is now parsed for all URL schemes (unless *allow_fragments* is "
"false), in accordance with :rfc:`3986`.  Previously, an allowlist of schemes "
"that support fragments existed."
msgstr ""
"現在會依照 :rfc:`3986` 為所有 URL scheme 剖析 fragment（除非 "
"*allow_fragments* 為 false）。先前則有一份支援 fragment 的 scheme 允許清單。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:211
msgid ""
"Out-of-range port numbers now raise :exc:`ValueError`, instead of returning "
"``None``."
msgstr ""
"超出範圍的連接埠號碼現在會引發 :exc:`ValueError`，而不是回傳 ``None``。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:215
msgid ""
"Characters that affect netloc parsing under NFKC normalization will now "
"raise :exc:`ValueError`."
msgstr ""
"在 NFKC 正規化下會影響 netloc 剖析的字元，現在會引發 :exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:219
msgid "ASCII newline and tab characters are stripped from the URL."
msgstr "URL 中的 ASCII 換行字元與定位字元會被去除。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:222
msgid ""
"Leading WHATWG C0 control and space characters are stripped from the URL."
msgstr "URL 開頭的 WHATWG C0 控制字元與空格字元會被去除。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:225 ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:452
msgid "Added the *missing_as_none* parameter."
msgstr "新增 *missing_as_none* 參數。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:233
msgid ""
"Parse a query string given as a string argument (data of type :mimetype:"
"`application/x-www-form-urlencoded`).  Data are returned as a dictionary.  "
"The dictionary keys are the unique query variable names and the values are "
"lists of values for each name."
msgstr ""
"剖析以字串引數給定的查詢字串（型別為 :mimetype:`application/x-www-form-"
"urlencoded` 的資料）。資料會以字典的形式回傳。字典的鍵是不重複的查詢變數名"
"稱，值則是由各名稱對應之值組成的串列。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:238 ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:287
msgid ""
"The optional argument *keep_blank_values* is a flag indicating whether blank "
"values in percent-encoded queries should be treated as blank strings. A true "
"value indicates that blanks should be retained as  blank strings.  The "
"default false value indicates that blank values are to be ignored and "
"treated as if they were not included."
msgstr ""
"可選引數 *keep_blank_values* 是一個旗標，用來指示百分比編碼的查詢中的空值是否"
"應被視為空字串。真值表示空值應保留為空字串。預設的假值表示空值應被忽略，並視"
"同未包含在內。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:244 ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:293
msgid ""
"The optional argument *strict_parsing* is a flag indicating what to do with "
"parsing errors.  If false (the default), errors are silently ignored.  If "
"true, errors raise a :exc:`ValueError` exception."
msgstr ""
"可選引數 *strict_parsing* 是一個旗標，用來指示如何處理剖析錯誤。若為 false"
"（預設值），錯誤會被默默忽略。若為 true，錯誤會引發 :exc:`ValueError` 例外。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:248 ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:297
msgid ""
"The optional *encoding* and *errors* parameters specify how to decode "
"percent-encoded sequences into Unicode characters, as accepted by the :meth:"
"`bytes.decode` method."
msgstr ""
"可選的 *encoding* 與 *errors* 參數指定如何將百分比編碼的序列解碼為 Unicode 字"
"元，與 :meth:`bytes.decode` 方法所接受的相同。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:252 ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:301
msgid ""
"The optional argument *max_num_fields* is the maximum number of fields to "
"read. If set, then throws a :exc:`ValueError` if there are more than "
"*max_num_fields* fields read."
msgstr ""
"可選引數 *max_num_fields* 是要讀取的最大欄位數量。若有設定，當讀取的欄位超過 "
"*max_num_fields* 個時，會引發 :exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:256 ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:305
msgid ""
"The optional argument *separator* is the symbol to use for separating the "
"query arguments. It defaults to ``&``."
msgstr "可選引數 *separator* 是用來分隔查詢引數的符號，預設為 ``&``。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:259
msgid ""
"Use the :func:`urllib.parse.urlencode` function (with the ``doseq`` "
"parameter set to ``True``) to convert such dictionaries into query strings."
msgstr ""
"使用 :func:`urllib.parse.urlencode` 函式（並將 ``doseq`` 參數設為 ``True``）"
"將這類字典轉換為查詢字串。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:264 ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:311
msgid "Add *encoding* and *errors* parameters."
msgstr "新增 *encoding* 和 *errors* 參數。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:267 ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:314
msgid "Added *max_num_fields* parameter."
msgstr "新增 *max_num_fields* 參數。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:270 ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:317
msgid ""
"Added *separator* parameter with the default value of ``&``. Python versions "
"earlier than Python 3.10 allowed using both ``;`` and ``&`` as query "
"parameter separator. This has been changed to allow only a single separator "
"key, with ``&`` as the default separator."
msgstr ""
"新增 *separator* 參數，其預設值為 ``&``。Python 3.10 之前的版本允許同時使用 "
"``;`` 和 ``&`` 作為查詢參數的分隔符號。現在已改為只允許單一分隔符號鍵，並以 "
"``&`` 作為預設分隔符號。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:276 ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:773
msgid ""
"Accepting objects with false values (like ``0`` and ``[]``) except empty "
"strings and byte-like objects and ``None`` is now deprecated."
msgstr ""
"除了空字串、類位元組物件和 ``None`` 之外，接受其他具有假值的物件（例如 ``0`` "
"和 ``[]``）的行為現已被棄用。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:283
msgid ""
"Parse a query string given as a string argument (data of type :mimetype:"
"`application/x-www-form-urlencoded`).  Data are returned as a list of name, "
"value pairs."
msgstr ""
"剖析以字串引數給定的查詢字串（型別為 :mimetype:`application/x-www-form-"
"urlencoded` 的資料）。資料會以名稱、值配對所組成的串列回傳。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:308
msgid ""
"Use the :func:`urllib.parse.urlencode` function to convert such lists of "
"pairs into query strings."
msgstr "使用 :func:`urllib.parse.urlencode` 函式將這類配對串列轉換為查詢字串。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:327
msgid ""
"Construct a URL from a tuple as returned by :func:`urlsplit`. The *parts* "
"argument can be any five-item iterable."
msgstr ""
"從 :func:`urlsplit` 所回傳的 tuple 建構 URL。*parts* 引數可以是任何具有五個項"
"目的可疊代物件。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:330 ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:368
msgid ""
"This may result in a slightly different, but equivalent URL, if the URL that "
"was parsed originally had unnecessary delimiters (for example, a ``?`` with "
"an empty query; the RFC states that these are equivalent)."
msgstr ""
"如果原本剖析的 URL 含有不必要的分隔符號（例如 query 為空的 ``?``；RFC 指出這"
"兩者是等價的），結果可能會是一個稍有不同但等價的 URL。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:334
msgid ""
"If *keep_empty* is true, empty strings are kept in the result (for example, "
"a ``?`` for an empty query), only ``None`` components are omitted. This "
"allows rebuilding a URL that was parsed with option "
"``missing_as_none=True``. By default, *keep_empty* is true if *parts* is the "
"result of the :func:`urlsplit` call with ``missing_as_none=True``."
msgstr ""
"若 *keep_empty* 為 true，空字串會保留在結果中（例如空 query 的 ``?``），只有 "
"``None`` 元件會被省略。這讓以 ``missing_as_none=True`` 選項剖析的 URL 得以被"
"重建。預設情況下，若 *parts* 是以 ``missing_as_none=True`` 呼叫 :func:"
"`urlsplit` 的結果，則 *keep_empty* 為 true。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:341 ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:379
msgid "Added the *keep_empty* parameter."
msgstr "新增 *keep_empty* 參數。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:347
msgid ""
"This is similar to :func:`urlsplit`, but additionally splits the *path* "
"component on *path* and *params*. This function returns a 6-item :term:"
"`named tuple` :class:`ParseResult` or :class:`ParseResultBytes`. Its items "
"are the same as for the :func:`!urlsplit` result, except that *params* is "
"inserted at index 3, between *path* and *query*."
msgstr ""
"此函式與 :func:`urlsplit` 類似，但會額外將 *path* 元件拆分為 *path* 與 "
"*params*。此函式回傳一個有 6 個項目的\\ :term:`附名元組 <named tuple>` :"
"class:`ParseResult` 或 :class:`ParseResultBytes`。其項目與 :func:`!urlsplit` "
"結果的項目相同，只是在索引 3（*path* 和 *query* 之間）多了 *params*。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:354
msgid ""
"This function is based on obsoleted :rfc:`1738` and :rfc:`1808`, which "
"listed *params* as the main URL component. The more recent URL syntax allows "
"parameters to be applied to each segment of the *path* portion of the URL "
"(see :rfc:`3986`). :func:`urlsplit` should generally be used instead of :"
"func:`urlparse`. A separate function is needed to separate the path segments "
"and parameters."
msgstr ""
"此函式基於已淘汰的 :rfc:`1738` 與 :rfc:`1808`，它們將 *params* 列為主要的 "
"URL 元件。較新的 URL 語法允許將參數套用到 URL 中 *path* 部分的每個區段（請參"
"閱 :rfc:`3986`）。一般而言，應使用 :func:`urlsplit` 來取代 :func:`urlparse`。"
"需要另外的函式來分離路徑區段與參數。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:364
msgid ""
"Combine the elements of a tuple as returned by :func:`urlparse` into a "
"complete URL as a string. The *parts* argument can be any six-item iterable."
msgstr ""
"將 :func:`urlparse` 所回傳之 tuple 的各元素組合成一個完整的 URL 字串。"
"*parts* 引數可以是任何具有六個項目的可疊代物件。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:372
msgid ""
"If *keep_empty* is true, empty strings are kept in the result (for example, "
"a ``?`` for an empty query), only ``None`` components are omitted. This "
"allows rebuilding a URL that was parsed with option "
"``missing_as_none=True``. By default, *keep_empty* is true if *parts* is the "
"result of the :func:`urlparse` call with ``missing_as_none=True``."
msgstr ""
"若 *keep_empty* 為 true，空字串會保留在結果中（例如空 query 的 ``?``），只有 "
"``None`` 元件會被省略。這讓以 ``missing_as_none=True`` 選項剖析的 URL 得以被"
"重建。預設情況下，若 *parts* 是以 ``missing_as_none=True`` 呼叫 :func:"
"`urlparse` 的結果，則 *keep_empty* 為 true。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:385
msgid ""
"Construct a full (\"absolute\") URL by combining a \"base URL\" (*base*) "
"with another URL (*url*).  Informally, this uses components of the base URL, "
"in particular the addressing scheme, the network location and (part of) the "
"path, to provide missing components in the relative URL.  For example:"
msgstr ""
"將「基底 URL」 (*base*) 與另一個 URL (*url*) 結合，以建構一個完整的（「絕"
"對」）URL。非正式地說，這會使用基底 URL 的元件，特別是定址 scheme、網路位置以"
"及（部分的）path，來補足相對 URL 中缺少的元件。例如："

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:394
msgid ""
"The *allow_fragments* argument has the same meaning and default as for :func:"
"`urlsplit`."
msgstr "*allow_fragments* 引數的意義與預設值皆與 :func:`urlsplit` 相同。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:399
msgid ""
"If *url* is an absolute URL (that is, it starts with ``//`` or ``scheme://"
"``), the *url*'s hostname and/or scheme will be present in the result.  For "
"example:"
msgstr ""
"若 *url* 是絕對 URL（亦即以 ``//`` 或 ``scheme://`` 開頭），則 *url* 的主機名"
"稱及／或 scheme 會出現在結果中。例如："

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:402
msgid ""
">>> urljoin('http://www.cwi.nl/%7Eguido/Python.html',\n"
"...         '//www.python.org/%7Eguido')\n"
"'http://www.python.org/%7Eguido'"
msgstr ""
">>> urljoin('http://www.cwi.nl/%7Eguido/Python.html',\n"
"...         '//www.python.org/%7Eguido')\n"
"'http://www.python.org/%7Eguido'"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:408
msgid ""
"If you do not want that behavior, preprocess the *url* with :func:`urlsplit` "
"and :func:`urlunsplit`, removing possible *scheme* and *netloc* parts."
msgstr ""
"如果你不想要這種行為，請先用 :func:`urlsplit` 與 :func:`urlunsplit` 對 *url* "
"進行前處理，移除可能存在的 *scheme* 與 *netloc* 部分。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:413
msgid ""
"Because an absolute URL may be passed as the ``url`` parameter, it is "
"generally **not secure** to use ``urljoin`` with an attacker-controlled "
"``url``. For example in, ``urljoin(\"https://website.com/users/\", "
"username)``, if ``username`` can contain an absolute URL, the result of "
"``urljoin`` will be the absolute URL."
msgstr ""
"由於絕對 URL 可能會作為 ``url`` 參數傳入，因此將 ``urljoin`` 用於受攻擊者控制"
"的 ``url`` 通常是\\ **不安全**\\ 的。舉例來說，在 ``urljoin(\"https://"
"website.com/users/\", username)`` 中，如果 ``username`` 可以包含絕對 URL，"
"``urljoin`` 的結果就會是該絕對 URL。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:423
msgid "Behavior updated to match the semantics defined in :rfc:`3986`."
msgstr "行為已更新為符合 :rfc:`3986` 中定義的語意。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:428
msgid ""
"If *url* contains a fragment identifier, return a modified version of *url* "
"with no fragment identifier, and the fragment identifier as a separate "
"string.  If there is no fragment identifier in *url*, return *url* "
"unmodified and an empty string (by default) or ``None`` if *missing_as_none* "
"is true."
msgstr ""
"若 *url* 包含 fragment 識別字，則回傳一個不含 fragment 識別字的 *url* 修改版"
"本，以及作為獨立字串的 fragment 識別字。若 *url* 中沒有 fragment 識別字，則回"
"傳未修改的 *url* 以及空字串（預設），或在 *missing_as_none* 為 true 時回傳 "
"``None``。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:433
msgid ""
"The return value is a :term:`named tuple`, its items can be accessed by "
"index or as named attributes:"
msgstr ""
"回傳值是一個\\ :term:`附名元組 <named tuple>`，其項目可以透過索引或具名屬性來"
"存取："

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:439
msgid ":attr:`url`"
msgstr ":attr:`url`"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:439
msgid "URL with no fragment"
msgstr "不含 fragment 的 URL"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:441
msgid "``None`` or empty string [3]_"
msgstr "``None`` 或空字串 [3]_"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:446
msgid ""
"See section :ref:`urlparse-result-object` for more information on the result "
"object."
msgstr ""
"關於結果物件的更多資訊，請參閱\\ :ref:`urlparse-result-object`\\ 一節。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:449
msgid "Result is a structured object rather than a simple 2-tuple."
msgstr "結果是一個結構化物件，而不是單純的 2-tuple。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:457
msgid ""
"Extract the url from a wrapped URL (that is, a string formatted as ``<URL:"
"scheme://host/path>``, ``<scheme://host/path>``, ``URL:scheme://host/path`` "
"or ``scheme://host/path``). If *url* is not a wrapped URL, it is returned "
"without changes."
msgstr ""
"從包裝過的 URL 中擷取 url（也就是格式為 ``<URL:scheme://host/path>``、"
"``<scheme://host/path>``、``URL:scheme://host/path`` 或 ``scheme://host/"
"path`` 的字串）。若 *url* 不是包裝過的 URL，則會原封不動地回傳。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:465
msgid "URL parsing security"
msgstr "URL 剖析安全性"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:467
msgid ""
"The :func:`urlsplit` and :func:`urlparse` APIs do not perform **validation** "
"of inputs.  They may not raise errors on inputs that other applications "
"consider invalid.  They may also succeed on some inputs that might not be "
"considered URLs elsewhere.  Their purpose is for practical functionality "
"rather than purity."
msgstr ""
":func:`urlsplit` 與 :func:`urlparse` API 不會對輸入進行\\ **驗證**。對於其他"
"應用程式認為無效的輸入，它們可能不會引發錯誤；對於某些在其他地方可能不被視為 "
"URL 的輸入，它們也可能成功執行。它們的目的在於實用的功能性，而非純粹性。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:473
msgid ""
"Instead of raising an exception on unusual input, they may instead return "
"some component parts as empty strings or ``None`` (depending on the value of "
"the *missing_as_none* argument). Or components may contain more than perhaps "
"they should."
msgstr ""
"它們在遇到不尋常的輸入時可能不會引發例外，而是將某些元件部分回傳為空字串或 "
"``None``\\ （取決於 *missing_as_none* 引數的值）。又或者元件包含的內容可能比"
"應有的還多。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:478
msgid ""
"We recommend that users of these APIs where the values may be used anywhere "
"with security implications code defensively. Do some verification within "
"your code before trusting a returned component part.  Does that ``scheme`` "
"make sense?  Is that a sensible ``path``?  Is there anything strange about "
"that ``hostname``?  etc."
msgstr ""
"若這些 API 回傳的值可能被用於任何涉及安全性的地方，建議這些 API 的使用者以防"
"禦性的方式撰寫程式碼。在信任回傳的元件部分之前，請先在你的程式碼中做一些驗"
"證。那個 ``scheme`` 合理嗎？那是一個合理的 ``path`` 嗎？那個 ``hostname`` 有"
"沒有什麼奇怪之處？諸如此類。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:484
msgid ""
"What constitutes a URL is not universally well defined.  Different "
"applications have different needs and desired constraints.  For instance the "
"living `WHATWG spec`_ describes what user facing web clients such as a web "
"browser require. While :rfc:`3986` is more general.  These functions "
"incorporate some aspects of both, but cannot be claimed compliant with "
"either.  The APIs and existing user code with expectations on specific "
"behaviors predate both standards leading us to be very cautious about making "
"API behavior changes."
msgstr ""
"什麼構成一個 URL 並沒有普遍明確的定義。不同的應用程式有不同的需求與想要的限"
"制。例如持續更新的 `WHATWG 規範 <WHATWG spec_>`_ 描述了面向使用者的網頁用戶端"
"（例如網頁瀏覽器）的需求，而 :rfc:`3986` 則較為通用。這些函式融合了兩者的某些"
"面向，但無法宣稱符合其中任何一者。這些 API 以及對特定行為有所預期的既有使用者"
"程式碼都早於這兩個標準，因此我們對於變更 API 行為非常謹慎。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:495
msgid "Parsing ASCII Encoded Bytes"
msgstr "剖析 ASCII 編碼的位元組"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:497
msgid ""
"The URL parsing functions were originally designed to operate on character "
"strings only. In practice, it is useful to be able to manipulate properly "
"quoted and encoded URLs as sequences of ASCII bytes. Accordingly, the URL "
"parsing functions in this module all operate on :class:`bytes` and :class:"
"`bytearray` objects in addition to :class:`str` objects."
msgstr ""
"URL 剖析函式原本只設計用來處理字元字串。在實務上，能將經過適當跳脫與編碼的 "
"URL 當作 ASCII 位元組序列來操作是很有用的。因此，此模組中的 URL 剖析函式除"
"了 :class:`str` 物件之外，也都能處理 :class:`bytes` 與 :class:`bytearray` 物"
"件。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:503
msgid ""
"If :class:`str` data is passed in, the result will also contain only :class:"
"`str` data. If :class:`bytes` or :class:`bytearray` data is passed in, the "
"result will contain only :class:`bytes` data."
msgstr ""
"若傳入 :class:`str` 資料，結果也只會包含 :class:`str` 資料。若傳入 :class:"
"`bytes` 或 :class:`bytearray` 資料，結果只會包含 :class:`bytes` 資料。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:507
msgid ""
"Attempting to mix :class:`str` data with :class:`bytes` or :class:"
"`bytearray` in a single function call will result in a :exc:`TypeError` "
"being raised, while attempting to pass in non-ASCII byte values will "
"trigger :exc:`UnicodeDecodeError`."
msgstr ""
"在單一函式呼叫中試圖混用 :class:`str` 資料與 :class:`bytes` 或 :class:"
"`bytearray`，會導致引發 :exc:`TypeError`，而試圖傳入非 ASCII 位元組值則會觸"
"發 :exc:`UnicodeDecodeError`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:512
msgid ""
"To support easier conversion of result objects between :class:`str` and :"
"class:`bytes`, all return values from URL parsing functions provide either "
"an :meth:`encode` method (when the result contains :class:`str` data) or a :"
"meth:`decode` method (when the result contains :class:`bytes` data). The "
"signatures of these methods match those of the corresponding :class:`str` "
"and :class:`bytes` methods (except that the default encoding is ``'ascii'`` "
"rather than ``'utf-8'``). Each produces a value of a corresponding type that "
"contains either :class:`bytes` data (for :meth:`encode` methods) or :class:"
"`str` data (for :meth:`decode` methods)."
msgstr ""
"為了讓結果物件更容易在 :class:`str` 與 :class:`bytes` 之間轉換，URL 剖析函式"
"的所有回傳值都會提供 :meth:`encode` 方法（當結果包含 :class:`str` 資料時）"
"或 :meth:`decode` 方法（當結果包含 :class:`bytes` 資料時）。這些方法的簽名與"
"對應的 :class:`str` 和 :class:`bytes` 方法相同（只是預設編碼為 ``'ascii'`` 而"
"不是 ``'utf-8'``）。每個方法都會產生一個對應型別的值，其中包含 :class:"
"`bytes` 資料（對於 :meth:`encode` 方法）或 :class:`str` 資料（對於 :meth:"
"`decode` 方法）。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:523
msgid ""
"Applications that need to operate on potentially improperly quoted URLs that "
"may contain non-ASCII data will need to do their own decoding from bytes to "
"characters before invoking the URL parsing methods."
msgstr ""
"若應用程式需要處理可能未經適當跳脫、且可能包含非 ASCII 資料的 URL，就必須在呼"
"叫 URL 剖析方法之前，自行將位元組解碼為字元。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:527
msgid ""
"The behaviour described in this section applies only to the URL parsing "
"functions. The URL quoting functions use their own rules when producing or "
"consuming byte sequences as detailed in the documentation of the individual "
"URL quoting functions."
msgstr ""
"本節所描述的行為僅適用於 URL 剖析函式。URL 跳脫函式在產生或處理位元組序列時有"
"自己的規則，詳見各個 URL 跳脫函式的說明文件。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:532
msgid "URL parsing functions now accept ASCII encoded byte sequences"
msgstr "URL 剖析函式現在接受 ASCII 編碼的位元組序列"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:539
msgid "Structured Parse Results"
msgstr "結構化剖析結果"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:541
msgid ""
"The result objects from the :func:`urlsplit`, :func:`urlparse`  and :func:"
"`urldefrag` functions are subclasses of the :class:`tuple` type. These "
"subclasses add the attributes listed in the documentation for those "
"functions, the encoding and decoding support described in the previous "
"section, as well as an additional method:"
msgstr ""
":func:`urlsplit`、:func:`urlparse` 與 :func:`urldefrag` 函式的結果物件是 :"
"class:`tuple` 型別的子類別。這些子類別新增了各函式說明文件中所列出的屬性、上"
"一節所述的編碼與解碼支援，以及一個額外的方法："

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:549
msgid ""
"Return the re-combined version of the original URL as a string. This may "
"differ from the original URL in that the scheme may be normalized to lower "
"case and empty components may be dropped. Specifically, empty parameters, "
"queries, and fragment identifiers will be removed unless the URL was parsed "
"with ``missing_as_none=True``."
msgstr ""
"以字串形式回傳原始 URL 重新組合後的版本。這可能與原始 URL 不同，因為 scheme "
"可能會被正規化為小寫，且空的元件可能會被捨棄。具體來說，除非 URL 是以 "
"``missing_as_none=True`` 剖析的，否則空的參數、query 與 fragment 識別字都會被"
"移除。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:555
msgid ""
"For :func:`urldefrag` results, only empty fragment identifiers will be "
"removed. For :func:`urlsplit` and :func:`urlparse` results, all noted "
"changes will be made to the URL returned by this method."
msgstr ""
"對於 :func:`urldefrag` 的結果，只有空的 fragment 識別字會被移除。對於 :func:"
"`urlsplit` 與 :func:`urlparse` 的結果，此方法所回傳的 URL 會套用上述所有的變"
"更。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:559
msgid ""
"The result of this method remains unchanged if passed back through the "
"original parsing function:"
msgstr "若將此方法的結果再傳入原本的剖析函式，結果會保持不變："

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:575
msgid ""
"The following classes provide the implementations of the structured parse "
"results when operating on :class:`str` objects:"
msgstr "下列類別提供處理 :class:`str` 物件時結構化剖析結果的實作："

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:580
msgid ""
"Concrete class for :func:`urldefrag` results containing :class:`str` data. "
"The :meth:`encode` method returns a :class:`DefragResultBytes` instance."
msgstr ""
"用於包含 :class:`str` 資料之 :func:`urldefrag` 結果的具體類別。:meth:"
"`encode` 方法會回傳一個 :class:`DefragResultBytes` 實例。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:588
msgid ""
"Concrete class for :func:`urlparse` results containing :class:`str` data. "
"The :meth:`encode` method returns a :class:`ParseResultBytes` instance."
msgstr ""
"用於包含 :class:`str` 資料之 :func:`urlparse` 結果的具體類別。:meth:`encode` "
"方法會回傳一個 :class:`ParseResultBytes` 實例。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:594
msgid ""
"Concrete class for :func:`urlsplit` results containing :class:`str` data. "
"The :meth:`encode` method returns a :class:`SplitResultBytes` instance."
msgstr ""
"用於包含 :class:`str` 資料之 :func:`urlsplit` 結果的具體類別。:meth:`encode` "
"方法會回傳一個 :class:`SplitResultBytes` 實例。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:599
msgid ""
"The following classes provide the implementations of the parse results when "
"operating on :class:`bytes` or :class:`bytearray` objects:"
msgstr ""
"下列類別提供處理 :class:`bytes` 或 :class:`bytearray` 物件時剖析結果的實作："

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:604
msgid ""
"Concrete class for :func:`urldefrag` results containing :class:`bytes` data. "
"The :meth:`decode` method returns a :class:`DefragResult` instance."
msgstr ""
"用於包含 :class:`bytes` 資料之 :func:`urldefrag` 結果的具體類別。:meth:"
"`decode` 方法會回傳一個 :class:`DefragResult` 實例。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:612
msgid ""
"Concrete class for :func:`urlparse` results containing :class:`bytes` data. "
"The :meth:`decode` method returns a :class:`ParseResult` instance."
msgstr ""
"用於包含 :class:`bytes` 資料之 :func:`urlparse` 結果的具體類別。:meth:"
"`decode` 方法會回傳一個 :class:`ParseResult` 實例。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:620
msgid ""
"Concrete class for :func:`urlsplit` results containing :class:`bytes` data. "
"The :meth:`decode` method returns a :class:`SplitResult` instance."
msgstr ""
"用於包含 :class:`bytes` 資料之 :func:`urlsplit` 結果的具體類別。:meth:"
"`decode` 方法會回傳一個 :class:`SplitResult` 實例。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:628
msgid "URL Quoting"
msgstr "URL 跳脫"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:630
msgid ""
"The URL quoting functions focus on taking program data and making it safe "
"for use as URL components by quoting special characters and appropriately "
"encoding non-ASCII text. They also support reversing these operations to "
"recreate the original data from the contents of a URL component if that task "
"isn't already covered by the URL parsing functions above."
msgstr ""
"URL 跳脫函式著重於接收程式資料，並透過跳脫特殊字元以及適當地編碼非 ASCII 文"
"字，讓資料能安全地作為 URL 元件使用。如果上述 URL 剖析函式尚未涵蓋這項工作，"
"它們也支援反向操作，從 URL 元件的內容重建原始資料。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:638
msgid ""
"Replace special characters in *string* using the :samp:`%{xx}` escape. "
"Letters, digits, and the characters ``'_.-~'`` are never quoted. By default, "
"this function is intended for quoting the path section of a URL. The "
"optional *safe* parameter specifies additional ASCII characters that should "
"not be quoted --- its default value is ``'/'``."
msgstr ""
"使用 :samp:`%{xx}` 跳脫序列替換 *string* 中的特殊字元。字母、數字以及字元 "
"``'_.-~'`` 永遠不會被跳脫。預設情況下，此函式用於跳脫 URL 的 path 部分。可選"
"的 *safe* 參數指定額外不應被跳脫的 ASCII 字元 --- 其預設值為 ``'/'``。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:644 ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:691
#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:720
msgid "*string* may be either a :class:`str` or a :class:`bytes` object."
msgstr "*string* 可以是 :class:`str` 或 :class:`bytes` 物件。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:646
msgid ""
"Moved from :rfc:`2396` to :rfc:`3986` for quoting URL strings. \"~\" is now "
"included in the set of unreserved characters."
msgstr ""
"跳脫 URL 字串時，從依循 :rfc:`2396` 改為依循 :rfc:`3986`。「~」現在被包含在非"
"保留字元 (unreserved characters) 的集合中。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:650
msgid ""
"The optional *encoding* and *errors* parameters specify how to deal with non-"
"ASCII characters, as accepted by the :meth:`str.encode` method. Although "
"these parameters default to ``None`` in the function signature, when "
"processing :class:`str` inputs, *encoding* effectively defaults to "
"``'utf-8'`` and *errors* to ``'strict'``, meaning unsupported characters "
"raise a :class:`UnicodeEncodeError`. *encoding* and *errors* must not be "
"supplied if *string* is a :class:`bytes`, or a :class:`TypeError` is raised."
msgstr ""
"可選的 *encoding* 與 *errors* 參數指定如何處理非 ASCII 字元，與 :meth:`str."
"encode` 方法所接受的相同。雖然在函式簽名中這些參數的預設值為 ``None``，但在處"
"理 :class:`str` 輸入時，*encoding* 實際上預設為 ``'utf-8'``，*errors* 則預設"
"為 ``'strict'``，這表示不支援的字元會引發 :class:`UnicodeEncodeError`。若 "
"*string* 是 :class:`bytes`，則不得提供 *encoding* 與 *errors*，否則會引發 :"
"class:`TypeError`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:659
msgid ""
"Note that ``quote(string, safe, encoding, errors)`` is equivalent to "
"``quote_from_bytes(string.encode(encoding, errors), safe)``."
msgstr ""
"請注意，``quote(string, safe, encoding, errors)`` 等同於 "
"``quote_from_bytes(string.encode(encoding, errors), safe)``。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:662
msgid "Example: ``quote('/El Niño/')`` yields ``'/El%20Ni%C3%B1o/'``."
msgstr "範例：``quote('/El Niño/')`` 會產生 ``'/El%20Ni%C3%B1o/'``。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:667
msgid ""
"Like :func:`quote`, but also replace spaces with plus signs, as required for "
"quoting HTML form values when building up a query string to go into a URL. "
"Plus signs in the original string are escaped unless they are included in "
"*safe*.  It also does not have *safe* default to ``'/'``."
msgstr ""
"與 :func:`quote` 類似，但也會將空格替換為加號，這是在建構要放入 URL 的查詢字"
"串時，跳脫 HTML 表單值所需的。原始字串中的加號會被跳脫，除非它們包含在 "
"*safe* 中。此外，*safe* 也不會預設為 ``'/'``。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:672
msgid "Example: ``quote_plus('/El Niño/')`` yields ``'%2FEl+Ni%C3%B1o%2F'``."
msgstr "範例：``quote_plus('/El Niño/')`` 會產生 ``'%2FEl+Ni%C3%B1o%2F'``。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:677
msgid ""
"Like :func:`quote`, but accepts a :class:`bytes` object rather than a :class:"
"`str`, and does not perform string-to-bytes encoding."
msgstr ""
"與 :func:`quote` 類似，但接受 :class:`bytes` 物件而非 :class:`str`，且不會執"
"行字串到位元組的編碼。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:680
msgid "Example: ``quote_from_bytes(b'a&\\xef')`` yields ``'a%26%EF'``."
msgstr "範例：``quote_from_bytes(b'a&\\xef')`` 會產生 ``'a%26%EF'``。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:686
msgid ""
"Replace :samp:`%{xx}` escapes with their single-character equivalent. The "
"optional *encoding* and *errors* parameters specify how to decode percent-"
"encoded sequences into Unicode characters, as accepted by the :meth:`bytes."
"decode` method."
msgstr ""
"將 :samp:`%{xx}` 跳脫序列替換為其對應的單一字元。可選的 *encoding* 與 "
"*errors* 參數指定如何將百分比編碼的序列解碼為 Unicode 字元，與 :meth:`bytes."
"decode` 方法所接受的相同。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:693
msgid ""
"*encoding* defaults to ``'utf-8'``. *errors* defaults to ``'replace'``, "
"meaning invalid sequences are replaced by a placeholder character."
msgstr ""
"*encoding* 預設為 ``'utf-8'``。*errors* 預設為 ``'replace'``，表示無效的序列"
"會被替換為佔位字元。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:697
msgid "Example: ``unquote('/El%20Ni%C3%B1o/')`` yields ``'/El Niño/'``."
msgstr "範例：``unquote('/El%20Ni%C3%B1o/')`` 會產生 ``'/El Niño/'``。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:699
msgid ""
"*string* parameter supports bytes and str objects (previously only str)."
msgstr "*string* 參數支援 bytes 與 str 物件（先前只支援 str）。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:707
msgid ""
"Like :func:`unquote`, but also replace plus signs with spaces, as required "
"for unquoting HTML form values."
msgstr ""
"與 :func:`unquote` 類似，但也會將加號替換為空格，這是解除 HTML 表單值的跳脫所"
"需的。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:710
msgid "*string* must be a :class:`str`."
msgstr "*string* 必須是 :class:`str`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:712
msgid "Example: ``unquote_plus('/El+Ni%C3%B1o/')`` yields ``'/El Niño/'``."
msgstr "範例：``unquote_plus('/El+Ni%C3%B1o/')`` 會產生 ``'/El Niño/'``。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:717
msgid ""
"Replace :samp:`%{xx}` escapes with their single-octet equivalent, and return "
"a :class:`bytes` object."
msgstr ""
"將 :samp:`%{xx}` 跳脫序列替換為其對應的單一八位元組 (octet)，並回傳一個 :"
"class:`bytes` 物件。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:722
msgid ""
"If it is a :class:`str`, unescaped non-ASCII characters in *string* are "
"encoded into UTF-8 bytes."
msgstr ""
"若 *string* 是 :class:`str`，其中未跳脫的非 ASCII 字元會被編碼為 UTF-8 位元"
"組。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:725
msgid "Example: ``unquote_to_bytes('a%26%EF')`` yields ``b'a&\\xef'``."
msgstr "範例：``unquote_to_bytes('a%26%EF')`` 會產生 ``b'a&\\xef'``。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:731
msgid ""
"Convert a mapping object or a sequence of two-element tuples, which may "
"contain :class:`str` or :class:`bytes` objects, to a percent-encoded ASCII "
"text string.  If the resultant string is to be used as a *data* for POST "
"operation with the :func:`~urllib.request.urlopen` function, then it should "
"be encoded to bytes, otherwise it would result in a :exc:`TypeError`."
msgstr ""
"將對映物件或由兩個元素的 tuple 所組成的序列（其中可包含 :class:`str` 或 :"
"class:`bytes` 物件）轉換為百分比編碼的 ASCII 文字字串。若產生的字串要作為 :"
"func:`~urllib.request.urlopen` 函式 POST 操作的 *data* 使用，則應將其編碼為位"
"元組，否則會導致 :exc:`TypeError`。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:738
msgid ""
"The resulting string is a series of ``key=value`` pairs separated by ``'&'`` "
"characters, where both *key* and *value* are quoted using the *quote_via* "
"function.  By default, :func:`quote_plus` is used to quote the values, which "
"means spaces are quoted as a ``'+'`` character and '/' characters are "
"encoded as ``%2F``, which follows the standard for GET requests "
"(``application/x-www-form-urlencoded``).  An alternate function that can be "
"passed as *quote_via* is :func:`quote`, which will encode spaces as ``%20`` "
"and not encode '/' characters.  For maximum control of what is quoted, use "
"``quote`` and specify a value for *safe*."
msgstr ""
"產生的字串是一系列以 ``'&'`` 字元分隔的 ``key=value`` 配對，其中 *key* 和 "
"*value* 都會使用 *quote_via* 函式進行跳脫。預設會使用 :func:`quote_plus` 來跳"
"脫值，這表示空格會被跳脫為 ``'+'`` 字元，而 '/' 字元會被編碼為 ``%2F``，這符"
"合 GET 請求的標準 (``application/x-www-form-urlencoded``)。另一個可以作為 "
"*quote_via* 傳入的函式是 :func:`quote`，它會將空格編碼為 ``%20``，且不會編碼 "
"'/' 字元。若要對哪些內容會被跳脫進行最大程度的控制，請使用 ``quote`` 並為 "
"*safe* 指定一個值。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:748
msgid ""
"When a sequence of two-element tuples is used as the *query* argument, the "
"first element of each tuple is a key and the second is a value. The value "
"element in itself can be a sequence and in that case, if the optional "
"parameter *doseq* evaluates to ``True``, individual ``key=value`` pairs "
"separated by ``'&'`` are generated for each element of the value sequence "
"for the key.  The order of parameters in the encoded string will match the "
"order of parameter tuples in the sequence."
msgstr ""
"當使用由兩個元素的 tuple 所組成的序列作為 *query* 引數時，每個 tuple 的第一個"
"元素是鍵，第二個元素是值。值元素本身可以是一個序列，在這種情況下，若可選參數 "
"*doseq* 的計算結果為 ``True``，則會為該鍵之值序列中的每個元素，各自產生以 "
"``'&'`` 分隔的 ``key=value`` 配對。編碼後字串中參數的順序，會與序列中參數 "
"tuple 的順序相同。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:756
msgid ""
"The *safe*, *encoding*, and *errors* parameters are passed down to "
"*quote_via* (the *encoding* and *errors* parameters are only passed when a "
"query element is a :class:`str`)."
msgstr ""
"*safe*、*encoding* 與 *errors* 參數會被傳遞給 *quote_via*\\ （*encoding* 與 "
"*errors* 參數只有在查詢元素為 :class:`str` 時才會被傳遞）。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:760
msgid ""
"To reverse this encoding process, :func:`parse_qs` and :func:`parse_qsl` are "
"provided in this module to parse query strings into Python data structures."
msgstr ""
"為了反轉這個編碼過程，此模組提供了 :func:`parse_qs` 與 :func:`parse_qsl`，用"
"來將查詢字串剖析為 Python 資料結構。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:763
msgid ""
"Refer to :ref:`urllib examples <urllib-examples>` to find out how the :func:"
"`urllib.parse.urlencode` method can be used for generating the query string "
"of a URL or data for a POST request."
msgstr ""
"請參閱 :ref:`urllib 範例 <urllib-examples>`，了解如何使用 :func:`urllib."
"parse.urlencode` 方法來產生 URL 的查詢字串或 POST 請求的資料。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:767
msgid "*query* supports bytes and string objects."
msgstr "*query* 支援 bytes 與字串物件。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:770
msgid "Added the *quote_via* parameter."
msgstr "新增 *quote_via* 參數。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:780
msgid "`WHATWG`_ -  URL Living standard"
msgstr "`WHATWG`_ - URL 現行標準 (URL Living standard)"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:781
msgid ""
"Working Group for the URL Standard that defines URLs, domains, IP addresses, "
"the application/x-www-form-urlencoded format, and their API."
msgstr ""
"制定 URL 標準的工作小組，該標準定義了 URL、網域、IP 位址、application/x-www-"
"form-urlencoded 格式及其 API。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:784
msgid ":rfc:`3986` - Uniform Resource Identifiers"
msgstr ":rfc:`3986` - 統一資源識別碼"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:785
msgid ""
"This is the current standard (STD66). Any changes to urllib.parse module "
"should conform to this. Certain deviations could be observed, which are "
"mostly for backward compatibility purposes and for certain de-facto parsing "
"requirements as commonly observed in major browsers."
msgstr ""
"這是目前的標準 (STD66)。對 urllib.parse 模組的任何變更都應符合此標準。可能會"
"觀察到某些偏差，這些偏差主要是為了向後相容，以及為了滿足主流瀏覽器中常見的某"
"些事實上的剖析需求。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:790
msgid ":rfc:`2732` - Format for Literal IPv6 Addresses in URL's."
msgstr ":rfc:`2732` - URL 中 IPv6 位址字面值的格式。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:791
msgid "This specifies the parsing requirements of IPv6 URLs."
msgstr "此文件規範了 IPv6 URL 的剖析需求。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:793
msgid ":rfc:`2396` - Uniform Resource Identifiers (URI): Generic Syntax"
msgstr ":rfc:`2396` - 統一資源識別碼 (URI)：通用語法"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:794
msgid ""
"Document describing the generic syntactic requirements for both Uniform "
"Resource Names (URNs) and Uniform Resource Locators (URLs)."
msgstr "描述統一資源名稱 (URN) 與統一資源定位器 (URL) 通用語法需求的文件。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:797
msgid ":rfc:`2368` - The mailto URL scheme."
msgstr ":rfc:`2368` - mailto URL scheme。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:798
msgid "Parsing requirements for mailto URL schemes."
msgstr "mailto URL scheme 的剖析需求。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:800
msgid ":rfc:`1808` - Relative Uniform Resource Locators"
msgstr ""
":rfc:`1808` - 相對的統一資源定位器 (Relative Uniform Resource Locators)"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:801
msgid ""
"This Request For Comments includes the rules for joining an absolute and a "
"relative URL, including a fair number of \"Abnormal Examples\" which govern "
"the treatment of border cases."
msgstr ""
"此 Request For Comments 包含了結合絕對 URL 與相對 URL 的規則，其中包括相當多"
"規範邊界情況處理方式的「非正常範例 (Abnormal Examples)」。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:805
msgid ":rfc:`1738` - Uniform Resource Locators (URL)"
msgstr ":rfc:`1738` - 統一資源定位器 (URL, Uniform Resource Locators)"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:806
msgid "This specifies the formal syntax and semantics of absolute URLs."
msgstr "此文件規範了絕對 URL 的正式語法與語意。"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:9
msgid "WWW"
msgstr "WWW"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:9
msgid "World Wide Web"
msgstr "World Wide Web （全球資訊網）"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:9
msgid "URL"
msgstr "URL（統一資源定位器）"

#: ../../library/urllib.parse.rst:9
